## 10. Summary

QuickConvert is designed with privacy in mind:

* No account required
* No personal information collected
* No location tracking
* No contacts access
* No camera or microphone access
* No unnecessary permissions
* Works offline
* Favorites and settings are stored locally on your device
* No personal data is sold or shared

By using QuickConvert, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
